%% W2D3 — GraphRAG & Knowledge Graphs — Query-Time Request Flow
%% Shows hybrid retrieval: parallel vector search + graph traversal, RRF merge, LLM generation

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Application Layer
    participant QNer as Query NER
    participant VStore as Vector Store
    participant GStore as Graph Store
    participant RRFMerger as RRF Merger
    participant LLM as LLM Generator

    User->>App: Submit multi-hop query
    App->>QNer: Extract entities from query
    QNer-->>App: Entity list (e.g. [Alice, Contract_42])

    App->>VStore: Embed query + cosine search top-K
    App->>GStore: Seed traversal with extracted entities

    Note over VStore,GStore: Both searches run in parallel

    VStore-->>App: Ranked chunk list (vector results)
    GStore->>GStore: Traverse N-hop neighbourhood\n+ fetch community summaries
    GStore-->>App: Ranked graph context\n(nodes, edges, summaries)

    App->>RRFMerger: Merge vector results + graph context
    RRFMerger->>RRFMerger: Compute RRF scores\nRRF(d) = Σ 1/(60 + rank_i(d))
    RRFMerger-->>App: Top-M merged context passages

    App->>LLM: Prompt = system + merged context + query
    LLM-->>App: Draft answer + confidence signal

    alt Confidence above threshold
        App-->>User: Final answer + provenance path
    else Confidence below threshold
        App->>GStore: Expand traversal depth by +1 hop
        GStore-->>App: Additional graph context
        App->>LLM: Retry with expanded context
        LLM-->>App: Revised answer
        App-->>User: Revised answer + provenance path
    end
